    "title": "Boston Blue star Sonequa Martin-Green teases Lena's emotional turning point in season 2 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sindhura Venkatesh ,\n1 hours ago Boston Blue followed a major storyline for Lena Silver during the final episodes of its first season. The character, played by Sonequa Martin-Green, was shot while on duty, leading to major changes in her personal and professional life. In an interview with Deadline, Martin-Green discussed Lena’s bond with Danny Reagan, played by Donnie Wahlberg, and how the relationship will continue in season 2. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
